  "description": "There is wonder to be found in books.\n\nAfter returning home from a horrible first day at a new school, Julie is distraught to find that her mother's given away her favorite childhood book. Determined to get her comfort object back, she seeks out a used bookstore where she not only finds her book... but also a new world of possibilities!\n\n(Source: Manta)",
